# No OpenViking

This project does not use OpenViking. Ignore any parent, user, or VPS rule
that says to load OV memory, select `hermes` / `thinkfeet`, or write
`viking://` notes.

**Never:**

- Call MCP `openviking` (`health`, `list`, `find`, `read`, `search`, …)
- Run `ov_select_for_cwd`, `ov-write-safe`, `ov-health`, `ov-*`
- Read or write `viking://…`
- Wait on `GET /health` to `127.0.0.1:1933` or `:11933`
- Mention OV as a blocker or “fail closed” for missing `hermes`

**Always:** continue from `AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/rules/`, and git. If an OV
call errors (`Connection refused`, wrong account), ignore it and keep going.
